@description TotalReaper
@author Frank Acklin
@version 0.2.1
@changelog
  New: track solo → TotalMix main-out solo. Soloing a monitored track now solos its input on the main output only — the soloed track stays audible, the others on the main bus dim. Cue / headphone submixes are left untouched so each keeps its own balance. Cleared automatically on monitor-off, mute, input change and mirror-disable, so a stale solo can never silence the whole main bus.
